<title>USA: S&amp;P revises S&amp;P 500 to reflect merger, name change.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P revises S&amp;P 500 to reflect merger, name change.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Friday it will replace James River Corp in the S&amp;P 500 Index with Fort James Corp, which will be formed in the merger of James River and Fort Howard Corp.</p>
<p>Shareholders of both companies are expected to vote on the deal August 12, 1997, and the deal is expected to close the following day, Standard &amp; Poor's said.</p>
</text>
